    {
      "id": "R13",
      "source": "ascend-reference-20261005",
      "title": "单机环境模板的可借鉴部分",
      "summary": "参考设备发现、可见卡、PET 分布式变量、CANN/ATB、HCCL、缓存及日志配置，并按真实拓扑审查每项设置。",
      "tasks": [
        "environment",
        "distributed",
        "memory",
        "performance"
      ],
      "stages": [
        "preparation",
        "troubleshooting",
        "optimization"
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "share.bashrc",
        "107020",
        "HCCL",
        "ACLNN_CACHE_LIMIT",
        "HOST_CACHE_CAPACITY",
        "TASK_QUEUE_ENABLE",
        "MULTI_STREAM_MEMORY_REUSE",
        "set -u"
      ],
      "evidence": "template_only",
      "conditions": "单机快速验证模板；16 卡两个 P8 mesh 的 HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE 示例。",
      "limitations": "原脚本写目录、软链接和 /etc/hosts，不可直接 source；延长超时不能修复死锁，缓存可能增 host 内存，网卡须按多节点实况核对。",
      "references": [
        {
          "path": "附件/share.bashrc"
